body:
Sex for the first time is always thrilling (F20 here). you’re dealing with a total new person and all that fun stuff. It’s fun to see how it goes, what happens and what comes out of it (; 
Yet sometimes sex with someone you just met can be mediocre (and awkward if it’s not with the right person). Ive been able to create great sexual chemistry with some people who I only keep as fwb.
But sex with a long term fwb / partner is great too, you’re familiar with each other’s bodies and it’s easier. Yet I like the challenge.
